{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"What's there to be mad about?\" She gives a forced smile, then resigns to a sigh a moment later. \"Look if this was about yesterday and the whole-\" she waves at nothing in particular, \"-wolf thing, I understand why everyone chose what they chose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:29:24.939000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866673082767900712","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"(In her mind, Meorys is repeating the Mender's words, *seize the day, seize the day, no time for regrets*)","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:30:29.906000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T13:30:38.790000Z","id":"866673355259772948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"The nameless grimaces. \"I spoke without thinking, I forgot to take into account what you were going through.\" He starts fidgeting. \"I just saw you attacking a helpless child and I thought you wouldn't like who you would be if you did go through that.\"\n\"And then we'd visit the ravens again... to forget...\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:31:28.149000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866673599547965470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"I just don't want us forgetting anymore.\" The nameless remarks, half sure because he himself went to forget. His words sound like a hypocrite's words to him.","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:32:23.513000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866673831762722856","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"I- **sigh** thank you for worrying. And yeah, we've had to give up a lot the past week. I understand.\" She starts rubbing her hands together. \"But I don't think I would've done that anyway - forget, I mean.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:35:58.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866674734171422740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Like I said, we already gave up a lot. If I ended up doing... what I wanted to do, then I'd just have to bear the weight of that decision.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:36:38.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866674899790856212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Forgetting can be a blessing, you know. I'm a priestess of the ravens now, buddy. Don't forget who you're talking to.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:37:06.340000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866675018024484875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"I'm sorry for even thinking of making that choice for you then. That was extremely wrong of me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:37:07.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866675020926156811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Oh.... that's.. wow.. a *lot* has happened. I'm not saying forgetting's bad, buddy. I'm just saying it's not for me.\" She gives a sad smile at Ser- Irynx.","created_at":"2021-07-19T13:38:17.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866675316395474972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
